    "updated_at": "2026-11-17T14:51:17Z",
    "body": "Decision: the Sinumerik post keeps the G83 dwell as `P<ms>`, as on main. The refusal of the first PR version is removed.\n\nThe maintainer, 2026-11-17: \"Can verify the G83 P dwell word works if you run (840D i iso mode (G291))\". Dialog choices: G83 \"Keep P, no refusal\"; P unit \"Yes, milliseconds\".\n\nSiemens' ISO dialects Function Manual (07/2021), section 6.3, table 6-2, lists no P on G83. The control check by the maintainer has priority for G83. The record is in `docs/decisions/2349-sinumerik-g83-dwell.md`. Follow-ups: #2356, #2357.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "pin": null,
